    "title": "Inglewood Residents: Register Now for 3rd Annual Santa's Village Gift Event for Local Youth - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 hours ago The City of Inglewood will hold its 3rd Annual Santa's Village Community Gift Giving event for local students aged 17 and under. Participants must be Inglewood residents and must attend the event to receive a gift. Registration is required and closes on November 30, 2025, at 6 p.m. PT.\nThe event is scheduled for KIA Forum Lot B. If needed, it may move to SoFi Stadium Lot C. Attendees must show proof of registration to enter. The event is intended to provide holiday gifts to local youth.\nVisit here for more details This post includes content assisted by AI tools. Please refer to the source for verification and additional information. Learn more.",
